{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07231","headline":"赴江西湖上赠皇甫曾之宣州 · 刘长卿","name":"赴江西湖上赠皇甫曾之宣州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫恨扁舟去，川途我更遥。\n东西潮渺渺，离别雨萧萧。\n流水通春谷，青山过板桥。\n天涯有来客，迟尔访渔樵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}